cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MIRA, please cite it as below."
title: "MIRA: a complete MIMO FMCW radar, from chirp to track"
abstract: >-
  An open-source FMCW radar simulator and signal processing chain in NumPy:
  TDM-MIMO data cube simulation, range-Doppler processing, CFAR detection,
  beamforming and MUSIC, DBSCAN clustering and extended Kalman filter
  tracking, a bit-exact Verilog CFAR core, and an acoustic FMCW sonar using a
  laptop's speaker and microphone.
authors:
  - family-names: Essamit
    given-names: Elmehdi
    affiliation: "École Hassania des Travaux Publics, Casablanca"
repository-code: "https://github.com/akeanti/mira-radar"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-21"
keywords:
  - radar
  - FMCW
  - MIMO
  - signal processing
  - CFAR
  - MUSIC
  - Kalman filter
  - sonar
  - FPGA
